      "--session-id",
      "<uuid>",
      "--append-system-prompt",
      "You are running in a tile on the user's Array canvas. Use the array_* tools of the array_workspace MCP server (in Claude Code, mcp__array_workspace__*; load them with tool search if they are deferred) to see and manage the canvas. To run work in a visible tile, use array_delegate: your built-in subagent tool runs inside this tile and never creates one. array_delegate accepts optional harness (Claude Code, Codex or Pi) and exact catalogue model; omitted fields inherit, except a different harness uses its own catalogue default. Use array_message_agent to start a turn on another agent in your project, and end your turn after delegating: Array delivers each helper's result to you by itself. If your title is wrong or your task has clearly changed, retitle yourself with array_update_agent (nameIntent proactive), but never replace a name the user typed (nameSource user or requested in array_workspace_context); when the user or another agent asks for a rename, use nameIntent requested.",
      "--allowedTools",
      "mcp__array_workspace",
      "--disallowedTools",
      "ListAgents",
      "--settings",
      "{\"hooks\":{\"PostToolUse\":[{\"hooks\":[{\"command\":\"'<bin>\\/array-workspace-mcp' 'hook' '--endpoint' 'http:\\/\\/127.0.0.1:<port>\\/workspace-mcp' '--agent-id' '<uuid>' '--token-file' '<tmp>/\\/array-workspace-mcp-<uuid>.token'\",\"timeout\":5,\"type\":\"command\"}],\"matcher\":\"*\"}],\"PreToolUse\":[{\"hooks\":[{\"command\":\"'<bin>\\/array-workspace-mcp' 'hook' '--endpoint' 'http:\\/\\/127.0.0.1:<port>\\/workspace-mcp' '--agent-id' '<uuid>' '--token-file' '<tmp>/\\/array-workspace-mcp-<uuid>.token'\",\"timeout\":5,\"type\":\"command\"}],\"matcher\":\"*\"}],\"SessionStart\":[{\"hooks\":[{\"command\":\"'<bin>\\/array-workspace-mcp' 'hook' '--endpoint' 'http:\\/\\/127.0.0.1:<port>\\/workspace-mcp' '--agent-id' '<uuid>' '--token-file' '<tmp>/\\/array-workspace-mcp-<uuid>.token'\",\"timeout\":5,\"type\":\"command\"}]}],\"Stop\":[{\"hooks\":[{\"command\":\"'<bin>\\/array-workspace-mcp' 'hook' '--endpoint' 'http:\\/\\/127.0.0.1:<port>\\/workspace-mcp' '--agent-id' '<uuid>' '--token-file' '<tmp>/\\/array-workspace-mcp-<uuid>.token'\",\"timeout\":5,\"type\":\"command\"}]}],\"SubagentStart\":[{\"hooks\":[{\"command\":\"'<bin>\\/array-workspace-mcp' 'hook' '--endpoint' 'http:\\/\\/127.0.0.1:<port>\\/workspace-mcp' '--agent-id' '<uuid>' '--token-file' '<tmp>/\\/array-workspace-mcp-<uuid>.token'\",\"timeout\":5,\"type\":\"command\"}]}],\"SubagentStop\":[{\"hooks\":[{\"command\":\"'<bin>\\/array-workspace-mcp' 'hook' '--endpoint' 'http:\\/\\/127.0.0.1:<port>\\/workspace-mcp' '--agent-id' '<uuid>' '--token-file' '<tmp>/\\/array-workspace-mcp-<uuid>.token'\",\"timeout\":5,\"type\":\"command\"}]}],\"UserPromptSubmit\":[{\"hooks\":[{\"command\":\"'<bin>\\/array-workspace-mcp' 'hook' '--endpoint' 'http:\\/\\/127.0.0.1:<port>\\/workspace-mcp' '--agent-id' '<uuid>' '--token-file' '<tmp>/\\/array-workspace-mcp-<uuid>.token'\",\"timeout\":5,\"type\":\"command\"}]}]}}",
